  DEMO   ENGLISH   CONFIG (1.0)
  ROOTCAT   S.
  FILES.
  LEXENTRIES   (DEMO   ENGLISH).
  TEMPLATES (DEMO   ENGLISH).
  RULES   (DEMO   ENGLISH).
  GOVERNABLERELATIONS    SUBJ OBJ OBJ2 OBL.
  SEMANTICFUNCTIONS    ADJUNCT.
  NONDISTRIBUTIVES    NUM PERS.
  EPSILON   e.

----

DEMO   ENGLISH   RULES (1.0)


   S --> ( ( NP: @GF )*,
           ( PP: @GF )* )
         V: ^=!.
	
   NP --> N: ^=!.


   PP --> P: ^=!;
          NP: (^ OBJ)=!.

----

DEMO   ENGLISH   TEMPLATES (1.0)


INTRANS(P)   = (^ PRED) = 'P<(^ SUBJ)>'.

TRANS(P)     = (^ PRED) = 'P<(^ SUBJ)(^ OBJ)>'.

OPT-TRANS(P) = { @(INTRANS P) | @(TRANS P) }.

DITRANS(P)   = (^ PRED) = 'P<(^ SUBJ)(^ OBJ)(^ OBL)>'.

PREP(P)      = (^ PRED)  = 'P<(^ OBJ)>'
               (^ PFORM) = P.


GF = { (^ SUBJ) = !
     | (^ OBJ)  = !
     | (^ OBJ2) = !
     | (^ OBL)  = !
     | ! $ (^ ADJUNCT) }.

N-CASE(P) = (^ PRED) = 'P'
            (^ NUM)  = sg
            (^ PERS) = 3
            { (^ CASE) = nom  (SUBJ ^)     "nominative -> I'm a subject"
            | (^ CASE) = acc  (OBJ ^) }.   "accusative -> I'm an object"
----

DEMO   ENGLISH   LEXICON (1.0)

"NOUNS"

plim   N * @(N-CASE gorilla).
tam    N * @(N-CASE garden).
tipf   N * @(N-CASE banana).
bobo   N * @(N-CASE baboon).

"VERBS  (verb-final)"

taotao V * @(OPT-TRANS eat).     
guagua V * @(DITRANS give).

"PREPOSITIONS"

ya     P * @(PREP ya).           "'in'  (locative)"
di     P * @(PREP di).           "'to'  (recipient)"

----
